  },
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "As an {artist} who shares her {journey} on social media, I'm often asked by {curious followers} how to begin an art journey. {Unfortunately} , there is no {magic} list I can offer.I do remember, though, what it was like to be a complete {beginner} .It can feel both {amazing} and {awkward} .At first, you might feel that any real skill is {absent} , and you may feel {bitter} about not reaching your goal as quickly as you'd hoped.So I've put together some good tips for starting an art journey.",
      "cn": "作为一名在社交媒体上分享自己艺术 历程 的 艺术家 ，我经常被 好奇的粉丝 们问及如何开启艺术之旅。 很遗憾 ，我没办法给他们提供一份 魔法 清单。不过，我的确记得自己完全是个 新手 时的情形。那种感觉既 美妙 又 令人不知所措 。一开始，你可能觉得自己 缺乏 真正的技巧，还会因为没能像自己期望的那样迅速达成目标而感到 沮丧 。所以，我整理了一些开启艺术之旅的实用建议。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "Start small.I suggest using a sketchbook ( (素描本) ) for small studies.These small studies provide {inspiration} and may be a {springboard} for more complex works in the future.Don't throw away your {amateur} art.It's important to {acknowledge} that art is a long journey.You'll want to look back on your journey to see how far you've come.",
      "cn": "从小处着手。我建议使用素描本进行小幅习作。这些习作能带来 灵感 ，或许日后还会成为创作更复杂作品的 跳板 。不要扔掉你 业余 水平的画作。重要的是要 承认 ，艺术之路是漫长的。你会希望回顾自己的历程，看看自己取得了多大的进步。"
    },
    {
      "num": "03",
      "en": "Paint often and paint from life.There's no better way to improve than to put in those {brush} miles.Whether you paint {still} life, {portraits} , or landscapes, paint from life as much as possible even when you get {bored} .By {capturing} the details of a {flower} or a {fruit} , you will develop a better understanding of light and {shadow} .The painting muscle memory only comes with repetition.",
      "cn": "经常画画，而且要写生。没有比多动 笔 更好的精进方法了。无论你画的是 静 物、 肖像 还是风景，即使你会感到 无聊 ，也要尽可能多地写生。通过 捕捉花朵 或 水果 的细节，你将更好地理解光 影 的原理。绘画的肌肉记忆只会随着重复而形成。"
    },
    {
      "num": "04",
      "en": "{Continually} challenge yourself to try something new.Get out of your comfort zone. {Artistic} growth can be a bit {painful} .You may {doubt} how it will turn out.Welcome to the club; we've all been there.Many artists find that their {ambition} grows once they experiment with different materials or tools—this is often how the most {extraordinary} works of art are born. {Anybody} willing to learn can succeed in {attaining} new levels of expression.When you {anticipate} challenges, you may find that the results are more rewarding than you expected.",
      "cn": "不断 挑战自己，尝试新的事物。走出你的舒适区。 艺术的 成长可能会有点 痛苦 。你可能会 怀疑 最终的成效。欢迎成为我们中的一员——大家都有过这样的处境。许多艺术家发现，一旦尝试了不同的材料或工具，他们的 野心 就会增长——最 非凡的 艺术作品通常就是这样诞生的。只要愿意学习， 任何人 都可以成功地 达到 新的艺术表现水平。当你 预料 到会有挑战时，你会发现结果比你所预期的更令人满意。"
    },
    {
      "num": "05",
      "en": "Share your work if you feel comfortable doing so.It's a good way to {advertise} your passion for painting.One of the most difficult things is the fear of being {judged} .But seeking and accepting {constructive} feedback ( (反馈) ) is crucial to growth.I post my work on social media and, in turn, have met some of the kindest people.They make me feel valued and {respected} , no matter my level of artistic ability.",
      "cn": "在感到自在的前提下分享你的作品。这是 宣传 你对绘画的热情的好方法。害怕被 评判 是最困难的事情之一。但寻求和接受 建设性的 反馈对你的成长至关重要。我在社交媒体上发布了我的作品，因而遇到了一些最善良的人。无论我的艺术造诣如何，他们都让我感到自己受到重视和 尊重 。"
    },
    {
      "num": "06",
      "en": "The journey you're on won't follow a straight path.You'll hit {roadblocks} , and you'll feel discouraged at times.Push through, give it time and put in the effort.You will {harvest} the rewards of an artistic life.",
      "cn": "你所踏上的旅程并非一帆风顺。你会遇到 阻碍 ，有时还会感到气馁。坚持下去，耐心等待，并付出努力。你终将 收获 艺术人生的回馈。 5NoOncib/NjiX02BpMIzP4m+378Hw1xTRxUdPaP/PFjKUFq4K2G7tp6ZLYoCE601yW1W39VMdLmovFdSHs4nVQ=="
    }
  ],
